      "description": "Jobs at W&L Skip to Content About W&L Academics Admissions & Aid Campus Life Outcomes Alumni Current Students Faculty & Staff Families Visitors | News Events Arts Athletics Giving Jobs at W&L Washington and Lee University Employment Opportunities Jobs at W&L Employment Opportunities Human Resources Jobs at W-L Faculty Positions Staff Positions Workday Application Instructions Information and Accommodations Request an Accommodation Annual Security and Fire Safety Report (Clery Act) Jobs at W&L Washington and Lee University strives to recruit and retain exceptionally qualified faculty and staff who are committed to the values of the University. We work to provide compensation consistent with peer institutions, enhanced benefits, training opportunities, and work-life initiatives that allow employees to be successful at home and at work. Positions are open until filled unless otherwise noted. If a position is not listed, it has been closed to additional applications. Open Positions Faculty Positions Staff Positions To apply for positions with Workday in the website address: Staff Application Instructions for New External Applicants (Workday) Staff Application Instructions for Current W&L Employees (Workday) Employment Opportunities Human Resources Jobs at W&L Faculty Positions Staff Positions Information and Accommodations Request an Accommodation Annual Security and Fire Safety Report (Clery Act) Anne Remington Director of Talent Acquisition P: 540-458-8355 E: aremington@wlu.edu 204 W. Washington Street Lexington, VA 24450 204 W. Washington St. | Lexington VA 24450 | 540-458-8400 Social Navigation Facebook Twitter Instagram Vimeo YouTube LinkedIn VISITOR NAVIGATION GPS Information Fast Facts Maps & Directions Virtual Tour Employment Opportunities CAMPUS NAVIGATION Directory Emergency Resources Accessibility Legal Notices Privacy Policy Title IX/Non-Discrimination © Copyright 2026 Washington and Lee University Search About W&L Academics Admissions 